      "writtenOn": "2026-04-21T13:05:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You are capturing server_crt, server_key, and ca_crt by value in the thread lambda. Since these are std::string_view, you are capturing the pointer and length. If the original strings passed to start() are destroyed before the thread reads them, you\u0027ll have a use-after-free. Recommendation: Capture them as std::string to ensure the thread owns the data.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 47,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 49,
        "endChar": 5
      },
      "revId": "d80a6858ef95232ac4b0a45a755aae3a5e67bbf1",
